---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { existsSync } from 'node:fs';

// Show the download link only once a resume PDF is in public/.
const hasResume = existsSync('public/Eli_Santos_Resume.pdf');
---
<Base title="About" description="Education, leadership and skills of Eli Santos, chemical engineering student at UNR.">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <p>
    I'm a chemical engineering senior at the University of Nevada, Reno, graduating in May 2027. I also have transfer
    coursework from West Valley, De Anza, Butte and Truckee Meadows community colleges.
  </p>
  {hasResume && <p><a href="/Eli_Santos_Resume.pdf">Download my resume (PDF)</a></p>}
  <p>My internships and research are on the <a href="/experience/">experience page</a>.</p>

  <h2>Coursework</h2>
  <p>
    Transport Phenomena I and II, Thermodynamics, Reactor Design, Separation Processes, Process Design and Economics,
    Computers in Chemical Engineering, Probability and Statistics, Materials Characterization and Particle Technology.
  </p>

  <h2>Leadership and teaching</h2>
  <p>
    I'm president of UNR's AIChE student chapter this year. Before that I spent a year as secretary and a year as vice
    president, and now I lead the officer team and organize site tours with manufacturers in the region.
  </p>
  <p>In 2025 I was a PASS leader and peer tutor at the UNR Tutoring Center, running weekly review sessions for 30+ students.</p>

  <h2>Skills</h2>
  <p><strong>Programming and data:</strong> Python (pandas, NumPy, SciPy, Matplotlib, scikit-learn, PyTorch), SQL, R, JMP, Excel.</p>
  <p><strong>Modeling:</strong> kinetic and thermodynamic modeling, nonlinear regression, root-finding and ODE solving, SPC, root cause and failure analysis, FMEA and FTA.</p>
  <p><strong>Engineering tools:</strong> ChemCAD, AutoCAD, P&amp;ID interpretation, MES, Microsoft Copilot Studio.</p>
</Base>

<style>
  strong { font-family: var(--font-sans); font-weight: 600; }
</style>
